knext bundled fix for vinext 1.1.0 (dist output)
Upstream: https://github.com/cloudflare/vinext/pull/3436
What it fixes: Nitro builds: `outputFileTracingIncludes` / `outputFileTracingExcludes` from next.config are applied to the traced server dependencies.
This is the maintainer's version of the PR: Next.js route-key matching (per route, negated keys, generated metadata and
parallel-slot entry names, root instrumentation/middleware entries), Next.js glob semantics (a ported minimatch/brace expansion,
failing safe on unsupported shapes), the legacy `experimental.outputFileTracing*` keys, and a `writeBundle` copy for builds where
Nitro skips its dependency trace. New modules: dist/build/{glob-match,trace-glob,nitro-trace-includes}.js.
Retire: delete this file (and its manifest entry) when the pinned vinext is >= the first
release that includes cloudflare/vinext#3436.
Ported by hand from the upstream src change to the published 1.1.0 dist files.
Applied by `knext vinext-patches` (runs from the app's postinstall and before `knext build`).

